# Mobile Layout Patterns — Halo Care

## Screen Structure
Every screen follows this flex-column skeleton:
```
ScreenLayout (100% height, overflow: hidden, flex column)
  ├── [optional header — flexShrink: 0]
  └── main (flex: 1, minHeight: 0, overflow: hidden, flex column)
        ├── Scroll area (flex: 1, minHeight: 0, overflowY: auto, overflowX: hidden)
        ├── FloatingActionPill (flexShrink: 0) — contextual primary CTA
        ├── BottomNavigationEnhanced (flexShrink: 0, height: 56px)
        └── HomeIndicator (position: absolute)
```

## Overflow Rules
- Parent containers: `overflow: hidden` to contain children
- Scroll containers: `overflowY: auto; overflowX: hidden` (never allow horizontal scroll)
- Grid children: `minWidth: 0; overflow: hidden` (prevents 1fr blowout)
- Text: `overflow: hidden; textOverflow: ellipsis; whiteSpace: nowrap` for single-line truncation

## Sizing
- Never use `100vw` (includes scrollbar width). Use `width: 100%`.
- Never use `height: 100vh` directly on components (mobile address bar). Use `height: 100%` from a parent.
- Touch targets: minimum 44px for buttons and tappable areas.
- Spacing: use `theme.spacing.*` tokens, never raw pixel values for margins/padding.

## Sticky Elements
- Use `position: sticky` inside scroll containers (PullToRefresh).
- Always set explicit `top` value and `zIndex`.
- Apply `background` matching the screen bg + `backdropFilter: blur(12px)` for glass effect.
- Sticky stack: unit bar at `top: 0`, section headers at `top: <unit-bar-height>`.

## Component Sizing Guide
- Bottom nav: 56px height
- FloatingActionPill: 14px vertical padding, full-width
- Secondary FAB: 48px circle
- Favorite slider cards: 88px wide
- Room card collapsed: ~44px
- Avatar sizes: 20px (mini stack), 32px (room cell), 42px (favorite card), 44px (resident card)
